Package: uke-orangefox-recovery
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Uke OrangeFox v003 preview delivery data
 Delivers existing Android recovery artifacts with pinned source and license
 records. This package does not compile recovery, flash a partition, change
 boot selection, or run an installer. The IMG requires the installed Android
 boot stack; temporary fastboot boot and ZIP installation are unavailable.
 Physical compatibility and rollback remain unqualified.
